{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ac23b765-9f2e-8da4-8b99-f6c6317e0a4c",
  "created_at": "2026-02-03T11:41:47-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Adriana Mejia",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:38:32-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:38:37-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, Kevin! Wonderful, I got a person right away. This is Adriana Mejia. I'm calling about my trash pickup, or really, a pickup that didn't happen."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:38:49-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sure. Let me grab some info. What's the address there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:38:55-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 286 Bliss Road, over on the Easton's Beach side. Great, thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:39:01-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "286 Bliss Road, got it. So what got missed, the trash or the recycling?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:39:08-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The trash, and the recycling too, actually! They came by neither one. And this is the second miss in a row, Kevin. Last week nothing, and this morning, nothing. The bins are still sitting at the curb."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:39:24-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, second week in a row, bins at the curb, 286 Bliss. I'll note that. Were they out early, before seven?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:39:34-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh yes! I put them out last night, the lids closed, nice and neat, right at the end of the driveway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:39:44-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. I'll put in a missed-pickup report for you. Anything else on it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:39:50-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, one more thing! I have an old appliance, a washing machine, that's been in my garage forever. Can the city haul that away? How do I do that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:40:03-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Washers usually aren't something that goes out with the regular trash. Large items like that typically need to be scheduled for a separate pickup, or taken to the drop-off. I can have someone from the office call you with the details on the right way to set it up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:40:24-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wonderful! Yes, please do that. I can't lift it myself, so pickup would be best."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:40:31-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, noting that. Large appliance, pickup preferred. What's the best number to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:40:38-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0181. That's my landline, and I'm usually home. Though if I don't hear the phone, I'm probably in the back room with my sewing machine. I quilt, you see, and I'm sewing a border onto a blanket right now! Big project."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:40:56-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nice. Okay, so 401-555-0181. I'll let them know to let it ring a while."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:41:03-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ha, yes, great! Let it ring!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:41:07-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, so I've got the missed trash and recycling at 286 Bliss Road, second miss in a row, and a callback about the washer. Somebody should get back to you in a day or two. And the crew should look at that route."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:41:26-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect! And should I leave the bins out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:41:30-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, leave them out for now. If they're still full tomorrow, call us back and we'll push it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:41:38-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wonderful. Thank you so much, Kevin! Have a great day!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:41:43-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Mrs. Mejia. Take care."
    }
  ],
